{"material_id": "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2013a.q28.material.recovered", "text": "在一次讨论课上，老师问学生：“雪融化后变成什么？”张红抢先回答：“雪融化后变为水。”黄阳想了想说：“雪融化后变成泥土。”柳丽慢条斯理地回答：“雪融化后变成了春天。”老师评价道：“张红反应敏捷，回答准确，可以得到满分。黄阳和柳丽真不知你们怎么想的，要是给分，只能得0分。”", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "73448f95f6a310400fc5491a646fd5d969a576bf140e0a221b484445f221b083", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2304, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2439, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "73448f95f6a310400fc5491a646fd5d969a576bf140e0a221b484445f221b083"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2013a.q28"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m3.k01", "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m4.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.302.r014", "ntce.outline.302.r015", "ntce.outline.302.r016", "ntce.outline.302.r024"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2013a.q28"], "word_count": 135, "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "jiaoyuzhishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "73448f95f6a310400fc5491a646fd5d969a576bf140e0a221b484445f221b083", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2304, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2439, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status":